{%- comment -%}
  Gift Card Template

  This template displays a gift card with its details and redemption information.
  It's a standalone page (no layout) that customers see when they receive or view a gift card.

  Features:
  - Displays gift card balance in the shop's currency
  - Shows expiration date if applicable
  - Displays shop logo or default gift card image
  - Shows the gift card code for redemption
  - Includes Apple Wallet integration (if pass_url is available)
  - Handles expired/disabled gift cards with appropriate messaging
  - Uses critical CSS for fast loading
  - Includes meta tags for SEO and social sharing

  Gift Card Object Properties Used:
  - gift_card.balance: The monetary value of the gift card
  - gift_card.enabled: Whether the gift card is active
  - gift_card.expired: Whether the gift card has expired
  - gift_card.expires_on: The expiration date (if set)
  - gift_card.code: The unique gift card code
  - gift_card.pass_url: URL for Apple Wallet pass (if available)

  Settings Used:
  - settings.logo: The shop's logo image

  Translations Used:
  - gift_card.expired: Message for expired cards
  - gift_card.expires_on: Expiration date label
  - gift_card.card: Alt text for gift card image
  - gift_card.use_at_checkout: Instructions for using the card
  - gift_card.add_to_apple_wallet: Alt text for Apple Wallet button

  Assets Used:
  - critical.css: Critical CSS for styling
  - gift-card/card.svg: Default gift card image
  - gift-card/add-to-apple-wallet.svg: Apple Wallet button image
{%- endcomment -%}

{% layout none %}

<!doctype html>
<html lang="{{ request.locale.iso_code }}">
  <head>
    {% # Social, title, etc. %}
    {% render 'meta-tags' %}

    {{ content_for_header }}
  </head>

  <body>
    <main>
      <div class="shopify-section">
        <h1>{{ gift_card.balance | money }}</h1>

        {% if gift_card.enabled == false or gift_card.expired %}
          <p>{{ 'gift_card.expired' | t }}</p>
        {% endif %}

        {% if gift_card.expires_on %}
          {% assign expires_on = gift_card.expires_on | date: '%B %e, %Y' %}
          <p>
            {{ 'gift_card.expires_on' | t: expires_on: expires_on }}
          </p>
        {% endif %}

        <p>
          {% if settings.logo %}
            {{ settings.logo | image_url: width: 300 | image_tag: alt: shop.name }}
          {% else %}
            <img
              src="{{ 'gift-card/card.svg' | shopify_asset_url }}"
              alt="{{ 'gift_card.card' | t }}"
              width="300"
              height="200"
            >
          {% endif %}
        </p>

        <h2>{{ shop.name }}</h2>
        <p>{{ 'gift_card.use_at_checkout' | t }}</p>
        <p>{{ gift_card.code | format_code }}</p>

        {% if gift_card.pass_url %}
          <a href="{{ gift_card.pass_url }}">
            <img
              src="{{ 'gift-card/add-to-apple-wallet.svg' | shopify_asset_url }}"
              alt="{{ 'gift_card.add_to_apple_wallet' | t }}"
              width="200"
              height="60"
            >
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
